{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08857","headline":"杂诗 · 李白","name":"杂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日与明月，昼夜尚不闲。\n况尔悠悠人，安得久世间。\n传闻海水上，乃有蓬莱山。\n玉树生绿叶，灵仙每登攀。\n一食驻玄发，再食留红颜。\n吾欲从此去，去之无时还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}